#. comic315 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic315.htm:42
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic315#title.1"
msgid "\"GET READY\""
msgstr "«ГОТОВЬСЯ»"

#. comic315 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: ship4.gif
#: kidradd/comic315.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic315#p1.1"
msgid "\"Sheena's log: Alright, it's a new day. Time to tackle a new game.\""
msgstr "«Журнал Шины: Итак, новый день. Пора браться за новую игру»."

#. comic315 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: game.gif
#: kidradd/comic315.htm:153
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic315#p2.1"
msgid "\"That last game didn't pan out well; hopefully the next one will have better characters to recruit.\""
msgstr "«Прошлая игра не задалась; надеюсь, в следующей найдутся персонажи получше для вербовки»."

#. comic315 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: sheenatable.gif
#: kidradd/comic315.htm:206
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic315#p3.1"
msgid "\"Not knowing what kind of game to expect 'til we're inside frustrates me; it makes strategy impossible.\""
msgstr "«Меня бесит, что мы не знаем, какая игра нас ждёт, пока не окажемся внутри: так невозможно планировать»."

#. comic315 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: sheenastare.gif, raddblink.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic315.htm:258
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic315#p4.1"
msgid "\"Not that Radd or Bogey really care.\""
msgstr "«Хотя Улёту и Бяке всё равно»."

#. comic315 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastare.gif, raddblink.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic315.htm:264
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic315#p4.2"
msgid "What kind of butts do you think I'll be kicking today?"
msgstr "Кому я сегодня надеру зад?"

#. comic315 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastare.gif, raddblink.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic315.htm:268
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic315#p4.3"
msgid "I wonder if this folder has any dating sims?"
msgstr "А тут есть игры про свидания?"

