msgctxt "comic337#p5.1"
msgid "Somehow, I'd think you'd find that sort of cool."
msgstr "Я думала, тебе это покажется крутым."

#. comic337 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenafront.gif, raddtableb.gif
#: kidradd/comic337.htm:299
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic337#p5.2"
msgid "Weirdly, so would I..."
